mance improvements","user":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Establish a reproducible CI performance campaign for the workflow generator and its Jackin/Parallax consumers. Current commits preserve raw historical run/job timestamps, separate elapsed latency from aggregate execution, and define explicit tenfold targets and completion criteria.\n\nImplementation and controlled measurements are in progress. No speedup is claimed. The campaign record is plans/ci-performance/README.md; baseline observations retain source and effective PR merge revisions.\n\nValidation so far: current generator builds with --locked --no-default-features; dry-run scans succeed for all three checkouts; campaign documentation lint passes; historical timestamp arithmetic checked. Required coverage and trust boundaries remain in scope.","created_at":"2026-09-20T01:05:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T09:19:42Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos