.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/963.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/963","number":963,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: integrate approved workflow scanner sources","user":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Purpose\n\nThis PR is the signed-history replacement for #961. The previous PR imported\n`857646a0` without a sign-off, and repository DCO remediation is disabled. That\ncommit duplicated the content already present in `main`, so this branch starts\nfrom current `main` and cherry-picks only the independently approved,\nproperly-attributed source units. PR #961 remains open until this replacement\npasses independent review and hosted checks.\n\n## Exact scope\n\n- base: `main` at `b5a4b4afaa6ca807927cacc03659b570a895dd5c`\n- head: `fb78d85d464fd5082e5c161922afd7942380fabc`\n- 16 approved source commits plus one generated metadata refresh\n- generator output refreshed only in `.github/ci/project.toml` and\n  `.github/ci/.github-actions-generator-state`\n- no workflow YAML, fleet rollout, consumer migration, or merge/release action\n\nThe replacement tree is exactly equal to PR #961 head\n`5b9a16a620951b65bbfe0a5cf7b1ffe04a317303`; `git diff` between those trees is\nempty. The replacement has 17 commits ahead of current `main`; every one has a\n`Signed-off-by` and `Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>` trailer. The\nunsigned imported `857646a0` is absent.\n\n## Local verification\n\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `cargo test -p velnor-tools --all-targets` — 246 passed\n- `cargo test -p velnor-workflow --all-features --lib` — 1804 passed\n- `cargo test --workspace --exclude velnor-runner` — 3019 passed\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings` — passed\n- `cargo clippy -p velnor-workflow --all-features --all-targets -- -D warnings` — passed\n- authoritative workflow generator `--check` — passed\n\nPlease perform a fresh exact diff review and hosted CI/DCO review. Do not merge\nuntil those gates and independent review are complete.\n","created_at":"2026-09-19T22:36:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T04:12:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/963/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/963/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/963/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/statuses/056362aadb738279924ef05597f9a014392f48bf","head":{"label":"tailrocks:codex/github-first-g3-integration-signed","ref":"codex/github-first-g3-integration-signed","sha":"056362aadb738279924ef05597f9a014392f48bf","user":{"login":"tailrocks","id":78806509,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc4ODA2NTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/