gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Integrate current main and preserve hosted-only automatic/default-dispatch recovery while retaining the Velnor provider.\n- Route every hosted aarch64 release, preview Debian, guest, and image producer matrix row to ubuntu-24.04-arm.\n- Add native C/C++/ar/OpenSSL-family preflight and explicit Cargo linker variables; remove the misleading cross-compiler install from native arm64 guest setup.\n- Regenerate .github workflows through the source-built renderer.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Source-built scan: 17 units, github-hosted plus preserved Velnor universe.\n- Focused release tests: 102 passed.\n- Full velnor-workflow lib suite: 1768 passed.\n- Clippy with all features: clean.\n- actionlint preview.yml and release.yml: clean.\n- Generator dry-run after regeneration: 0 files would change.\n\n## Bootstrap note\n\nThe generated tree intentionally retains the currently published runtime pin 0dc79895ff1c5e88be7c3822c437e1c5b5282e12. The old pinned renderer cannot parse the typed verification_providers field, so pinned --check remains blocked until the new source renderer is bootstrapped/published and the pin is adopted. This PR makes no G1 completion claim; hosted PR and post-merge stable/preview evidence remain required.","created_at":"2026-09-19T22:22:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T08:01:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"