f_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/961.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/961.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/961","number":961,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: integrate approved generic workflow scanners","user":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Scope\n\nG0 tools/generator source preparation only. This PR carries the independently\napproved source integration chain:\n\n- estate scope contract\n- strict JSON validation\n- lane comparison\n- generic Skills scanner and validation\n- Rust include scanner/consumer support\n\nIt does not migrate consumers, alter fleet policy, release artifacts, or roll\nout the 32-repository estate. G1/G2 rollout remains blocked.\n\n## Exact refs\n\n- Base: `main` at `b5a4b4afaa6ca807927cacc03659b570a895dd5c`\n- Head: `codex/github-first-g3-integration` at\n  `5b9a16a620951b65bbfe0a5cf7b1ffe04a317303`\n- Current graph merge-base: `b5a4b4afaa6ca807927cacc03659b570a895dd5c`\n- Fresh-main synchronization merge:\n  `5913fa6ff07ad08fb42dc78ae1530e9f0e11b308`\n- Approved source integration review:\n  `G1/integration/review-857646a.md`\n\nThe synchronization merge had no content delta against its first parent.\nOriginal source commits were preserved with `cherry-pick -x`; signed-off and\nCodex co-author trailers remain intact.\n\n## Authoritative generation\n\nThe generator was run from `crates/velnor-workflow` after dry-run review:\n\n```sh\nmbx run --locked --manifest-path Cargo.toml -- --plain --force ../..\nmbx run --locked --manifest-path Cargo.toml -- --plain --check ../..\n```\n\nOnly these generator-owned metadata files changed:\n\n- `.github/ci/project.toml`\n- `.github/ci/.github-actions-generator-state`\n\nThe semantic change is the newly detected\n`rust-test-targets:velnor-tools:1`, with matching scan/output hashes. No\nworkflow YAML, consumer documentation, fleet, or rollout file changed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`: pass\n- `git diff --check`: pass\n- workspace Clippy, all targets, `-D warnings`: pass\n- `cargo test -p velnor-tools --all-targets`: 246 passed\n- `cargo test -p velnor-workflow --all-features --lib`: 1,804 passed\n- workflow all-features Clippy: pass\n- `cargo test --workspace --exclude velnor-runner`: 3,019 passed\n- generator `--check`: pass\n- eight pinned real Skills repositories: scan, Bun 1.4.0 helper syntax,\n  and docs-generator validation completed; no consumer files changed\n\nKnown baseline caveats remain documented in the integration evidence:\ntwo no-default-features closure feature tests fail identically on the base, and\nthe full workspace benchmark is host-sensitive while its targeted base and\nhead runs pass.\n\n## Review gate\n\nPlease review the complete final diff and all paginated review feedback and\nCI results. Do not merge until the independent exact-delta review and hosted\nchecks pass. This PR is source preparation only; no fleet rollout or consumer\ngeneration is authorized here.\n","created_at":"2026-09-19T22:11:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T22: