s://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/960","id":4580831765,"node_id":"PR_kwDOStNhZc8AAAABEQnyFQ","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/960","diff_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/960.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/960.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/960","number":960,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(workflow): keep release metadata out of checkout","user":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Root cause\nThe Preview Debian job downloaded `preview-metadata` into checkout-relative `metadata/` immediately before the release build. The fail-closed identity guard correctly observed `?? metadata/` and rejected the dirty tree.\n\n## Fix\nGenerated release/preview Debian jobs download metadata under `${{ runner.temp }}/velnor-release-metadata`; shell staging and release-tool calls use that temp directory. The clean-tree identity guard remains unchanged. Both schema generators and generated workflows are covered.\n\n## Evidence\n- Failing Preview run: 35468978367, amd64 job 105968085418, main `b5a4b4afaa6ca807927cacc03659b570a895dd5c`.\n- Local focused generator tests: `cargo test --locked -p velnor-workflow native_preview_produces_debs_with_rolling_identity` (2 passed).\n- Generator `--check`, fmt, and package clippy (`-D warnings`) pass.\n- ARM64 toolchain failure is separate and untouched.\n\nNo release or merge performed by this branch.\n","created_at":"2026-09-19T22:04:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T23:21:50Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b27461728395c6ba4ff228500ca863d0271e4c7b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/960/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/960/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/960/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/statuses/c8f7a2b353f9d2d6a60d3ad8bb2dc6299a108ceb","head":{"label":"tailrocks:codex/g1-preview-amd64-dirty-identity","ref":"codex/g1-preview-amd64-dirty-identity","sha":"c8f7a2b353f9d2d6a60d3ad8bb2dc6299a108ceb","user":{"login":"tailrocks","id":78806509,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc4ODA2NTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78806509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.co