/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/957/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/957/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/statuses/92387e88c32f933a9061b819256e535662655cb2"}},"author_association":"MEMBER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/952","id":4568108722,"node_id":"PR_kwDOStNhZc8AAAABEEfOsg","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/952","diff_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/952.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/952.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/952","number":952,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(workflow): restore the Docker seed and fetch the D19 pin in release legs","user":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Defects (B3 tag v0.1.277, run 35332416794)\n\n**D1 — release docker legs lack the seed lifecycle.** `full_commands` consumes `.velnor-docker-cache/seed` via `--build-context velnor-cache-seed`, but the release renderer suppresses the generic restore for `mutable_mount_seed` units (`s2/primitives/mod.rs`) and never emitted the seed lifecycle in its place (`render_mutable_mount_seed_restore_from_input` is unit-workflow-only). Both providers' docker legs failed with `stat .velnor-docker-cache/seed: no such file or directory`.\n\n**D4 — release workflow leg lacks the pin fetch.** The `--plain --check` guard resolves `closure_of_tree(pin)` from local history, but release checkouts are shallow and release legs never fetched the pin commit (the `Fetch D19 pin history` step is unit-workflow-only). The generator leg failed with `revision fdeed261… is not a commit`.\n\n## Fix (generator source, s2 pipeline)\n\n- `s2/primitives/ir.rs`: new `render_mutable_mount_seed_restore_for_unit` renders the seed restore + context preparation for a concrete `(provider, unit)` through the shared `render_seed_restore_steps` and the `unit_snapshot` grammar, so release legs share the seed CI saves (verified: release key compat `743cc362f16c` equals the CI caller's `seed_compat`). New shared `D19_PIN_FETCH_COMMANDS`; the unit-workflow step renders through it byte-identically (regen touched no unit workflow).\n- `s2/primitives/release.rs`: `render_release_unit_job` emits the seed lifecycle for seed units on every provider, and a hosted-only `Fetch D19 pin history` step (new `render_release_pin_fetch`) before the checks for units running `--plain --check`. Local legs already provision the pin via the pinned-renderer step.\n- Regen: `release.yml` + generator state only. `--dry-run` reports 0.\n\n## Regression tests\n\n- `native_release_seed_legs_restore_the_docker_seed_on_both_providers`: both legs restore + mkdir before run, generic restore stays suppressed, key carries concrete provider segments. Fails pre-fix.\n- `native_release_hosted_check_leg_fetches_the_d19_pin_before_running`: hosted leg fetches before run; velnor leg carries the pinned-renderer step instead. Fails pre-fix.\n\n## Gates\n\n`cargo test -p velnor-workflow` (1735 lib + all integration suites green), `cargo clippy -p velnor-workflow --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean, `cargo fmt --check` clean, `actionlint` clean, `--plain --force` then `--dry-run` = 0.\n\n## Follow-up (not in this PR)\n\nA pin-bump to the merge commit will be needed after merge so the declared D19 pin renders this tree.","created_at":"2026-09-18T11:07:14Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T11:07:20Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/952/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/952/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/952/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/statuses/a5c1c0bd5c92c4c52d58ccb21042b1b2c0b08637","head":{"label":"tailrocks:fix/release-leg-seed-pin-fetch","ref":"fix/release-leg-seed-pin-fetch","sha":"a5c1c0bd5c92c4c52d58ccb21042b1b2c0b08637","user":{"login":"tailrocks","id":78806509,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc4ODA2NTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78806509?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tailrocks/orgs","repo