ues/952/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/952/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/952/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/statuses/a5c1c0bd5c92c4c52d58ccb21042b1b2c0b08637"}},"author_association":"MEMBER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/pulls/948","id":4567703887,"node_id":"PR_kwDOStNhZc8AAAABEEGhTw","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/948","diff_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/948.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/velnor/pull/948.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/velnor/issues/948","number":948,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"C1 prep: bastion host-setup provisioner (authoring only, do not execute)","user":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Authoring-only C1 host-setup for work-plan STEP C1 action 3 (spec section 6 + 6.1). Zero bastion writes; execution waits for the B4+C gates and a dedicated C-gate infra agent.\n\n## Files (all new under `plans/bastion-three-provider-ci/c1-host-setup/`)\n- `provision-bastion.sh` — idempotent provisioner (`--check` / apply), step-mapped B1..C5 to the ansible source\n- `pins.env` — exact docker-ce set pins + key fingerprints + sources + 2026-09-18 resolution date\n- `targets.env` — bastion inventory entry (shell form of the `hosts.ini` pattern)\n- `README.md` — preconditions + exact execution command for the C-gate agent, decisions, MUST-NOT compliance, evidence\n\nShell was chosen over ansible to match repo conventions (`scripts/*.sh`, no ansible tooling here).\n\n## Key properties\n- Pins (2026-09-18, trixie amd64): docker-ce(-cli) `5:29.8.1`, containerd.io `2.3.5`, buildx `0.37.1`, compose `5.5.1`\n- Docker APT key fingerprinted fail-closed against two independent references (Ubuntu keyserver + published docs fingerprint); trixie InRelease verifies Good\n- Drain gates (exit 2) before dockerd-affecting changes; holds on docker set (+velnor-runner if present); no upgrade/dist-upgrade/autoremove/prune anywhere\n- Pre-flight route read precedes the pool decision; pools default off (selene-style), refused on conflict even when requested\n- Cosmetics (terminfo/shell) opt-in only, never abort; Drain-Docker block, drive-init, per-repo reservations, mise/nushell/holla, release-upgrade path all excluded with rationale in README\n\n## Validation (no host touched)\n- `bash -n` + `shellcheck` clean; MUST-NOT grep clean (see README for the exact audit)\n- Full `debian:13` (amd64) container matrix: `--check` purity, apply convergence, second `--check` exit 0, cosmetics landing, pools plan, pool-conflict / fingerprint-mismatch / drain refusals + ALLOW override. Dry-run caught and fixed 3 real bugs.\n\n## For the C-gate agent\nExecution command + preconditions are in the README. Re-verify pins at gate time if the date moved on."